00:15:24.140 --> 00:15:26.970
And that, by the way, is a good
lesson for digital agencies,

00:15:26.970 --> 00:15:29.120
and marketers and business people.

00:15:29.120 --> 00:15:31.720
That's because baseball
took the stance a decade ago

00:15:31.720 --> 00:15:33.980
that they would create an
organization called BAM

00:15:33.980 --> 00:15:36.540
and they would monetize
every piece of content

00:15:36.540 --> 00:15:40.590
