on YouTube and social media

00:15:40.590 --> 00:15:42.920
was taken down by Major League Baseball.

00:15:42.920 --> 00:15:45.120
Plus baseball teams
couldn't do their own stuff

00:15:45.120 --> 00:15:46.210
nor could players.

00:15:46.210 --> 00:15:49.110
It was all controlled at a
central level to monetize.

00:15:49.110 --> 00:15:51.170
They made a lot of
money in the short term,

00:15:51.170 --> 00:15:53.973
but they completely killed
the brand of the sport.

