Ed, I'm not really sure.

00:17:20.380 --> 00:17:22.270
The one thing that I really know about 5G.

00:17:22.270 --> 00:17:25.290
So, I think it's funny
how people think about 5G.

00:17:25.290 --> 00:17:27.590
Most people, if they're even aware of it,

00:17:27.590 --> 00:17:30.260
are like, "Cool, my phone will be faster."

00:17:30.260 --> 00:17:32.913
Meanwhile, this is a
transcending technology.

00:17:34.060 --> 00:17:37.430
5G will be the reason that
autonomous cars become real.

00:17:37.430 --> 00:17:40.700
Because the lag time will be zero.

00:17:40.700 --> 00:17:43.590
5G is the reason that a
surgeon could be woken up

00:17:43.590 --> 00:17:46.610
in Brazil tonight because she's the best

00:17:46.610 --> 00:17:48.070
in the world at a certain surgery,

00:17:48.070 --> 00:17:50.690
