while you're in New Jersey.

00:17:53.810 --> 00:17:54.660
That's amazing.

00:17:54.660 --> 00:17:58.240
So the speed in which information
moves is so incredible.

00:17:58.240 --> 00:17:59.430
I don't remember the exact fact,

00:17:59.430 --> 00:18:01.680
but this is not like from four to five.

00:18:01.680 --> 00:18:04.000
This is like from four
to 40, or four to 400.

00:18:04.000 --> 00:18:05.340
I don't remember if it's 10X or 100X.

00:18:05.340 --> 00:18:06.950
But it's profound.

00:18:06.950 --> 00:18:11.950
So I think that the ability
for information to move

00:18:12.360 --> 00:18:17.200
with no lag is what is
really going to be profound.

00:18:17.200 --> 00:18:19.520
Things like, you know,
when you start thinking

